  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The contract asks for the raw difference in conversion rates (email minus paid_search). The answer reports the adjusted (stratified) difference instead of the required raw difference.",
    "Overreach: The answer claims to estimate the causal effect of channel on conversion, but only a simple stratified adjustment was performed; no causal identification strategy is justified.",
    "Unacknowledged data problems: The dataset contains impossible values (e.g., customer_age = -1) and missing revenue entries, which are not mentioned as potential issues affecting the analysis."
